1
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:26,920
(There was a man)

2
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:32,560
(That sailed the seas)

3
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:36,640
What are you looking at?

4
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,000
How come...

5
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:43,840
Right, the GPS locator.

6
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:48,000
Angie, have you considered

7
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:52,720
why we found each other again in this life?

8
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:57,600
Maybe...Heaven wanted to give us
another chance?

9
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:03,800
I think Chow Kai-hin and Koo Ning-yuk
couldn't part with each other.

10
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:07,120
They installed a GPS locator

11
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:09,280
so they could find each other in this life.

12
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:13,840
It may be another mistake
to find each other.

13
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,640
I made a mistake.

14
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:18,360
I let you down.

15
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:21,080
I also let Chow Kai-hin down.

16
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,360
I wasted his effort to find Koo Ning-yuk.

17
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:29,600
Actually I'm not as good as Koo Ning-yuk.

18
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:33,840
Angie...you're fine.

19
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,800
You're great!

20
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,280
Even when I asked for a divorce,

21
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:41,120
you didn't blame me.

22
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:47,280
You said Heaven wanted to give us
a second chance.

23
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,960
I think Chow Kai-hin fought for this chance.

24
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:58,000
He taught me how to love someone

25
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:01,040
and the meaning of till death do us part.

26
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:12,720
Man Nga-kei, will you marry me again?

27
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:16,720
I promise I will settle down.

28
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:19,360
I will always be there for you.

29
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:23,120
I will only love you.

30
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,080
OK!

31
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:32,520
(He's coming home)

32
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:37,800
(Don't you cry)

33
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:43,440
(He's coming home)

34
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:49,120
You and Angie want to get married again?

35
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,720
After we have been through so much,

36
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:54,080
I realized Angie would do anything for me.

37
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:56,240
It was my fault I didn't cherish her.

38
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,400
Now I won't let her go again.

39
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,680
You treated her so bad.

40
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,800
Would she agree to it?

41
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,720
Angie and I talked about it.

42
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:05,080
We'll move to Fukuoka.

43
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,960
It's very nice and a lot of Hongkongers
have moved there.

44
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:11,520
Pack up and go? That's like child's play!

45
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,720
You abandon everything here for no reason

46
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:16,160
and start over somewhere so far away?

47
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:17,920
Are you two sure?

48
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,880
You decided for me without even asking me.

49
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,960
What makes you think I'll like it?

50
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,240
I'm not eating!

51
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,600
Just think...she used deepfake,

52
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:36,360
and harassed Yau You-fong and Man Nga-kei.

53
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,240
One person alone can't do all that.

54
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,640
Who else could be involved?

55
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:44,000
That'll depend on who benefits the most

56
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,680
from Siu Zi-yiu's death.

57
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,920
We recovered Siu Zi-yiu's phone.

58
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,040
Thanks.

59
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:55,360
Dinner didn't go so well, right?

60
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,560
No, it's about the same as usual.

61
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,000
Don't think too much about it.

62
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:03,680
Mom gave each of us an amulet.

63
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:07,680
Remember to hang onto it, OK?

64
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,120
Angie...

65
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,920
Let's reconsider moving overseas.

66
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,600
Didn't we already agree

67
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:20,040
to start over somewhere else?

68
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,920
I know you care about Mom.

69
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,320
She told us to think carefully just now.

70
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:26,560
She doesn't exactly object, right?

71
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,040
If she really doesn't want to go,

72
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,600
I won't force her.

73
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,520
But I really don't want to stay.

74
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,440
I have too many unhappy memories...

75
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,800
Mom is just saying it.

76
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,240
I know what she's thinking.

77
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:40,040
She was quite upset last time I moved out
when we got married.

78
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:43,160
I remember the time she fell down at home

79
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:45,680
it was the first time I wasn't
living with her.

80
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:49,720
She was in a foul mood
and couldn't sleep at night.

81
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,280
She was in a bit of a trance

82
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,880
and she was tired and weak.

83
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:56,040
I could feel she was lonely.

84
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:59,280
I feel bad about leaving her alone
in Hong Kong.

85
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,920
Let's decide later, OK?

86
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,240
OK, we'll do this later.

87
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,720
I asked you to come up

88
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:36,240
because I want you to see if
anything in here belongs to you.

89
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,040
If there are, take them back.

90
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:39,680
If not, I'll donate them

91
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:42,240
to earn some merit for my daughter.

92
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,680
Hello?

93
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,360
Get in.

94
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,400
Be careful!

95
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,680
Thanks, Sang.

96
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,160
Angie, go home and get some rest.

97
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:09,360
The director said we'll manage. Thanks.

98
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,600
Thank you.

99
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,040
Angie, how are you feeling?

100
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:17,040
Carrying the amulet from Mom

101
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,920
makes me feel unwell.

102
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,960
I felt something heavy on my chest.

103
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,880
Don't carry it if you don't feel well.

104
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,560
It's no big deal.

105
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,920
What is it, Angie?

106
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:32,320
I'm not sure if I'm being oversensitive.

107
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:37,120
I was going through the sketchbook
again last night,

108
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:42,800
I noticed the child bride
had a birth mark on her calf.

109
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:45,920
But Liz didn't have any birth marks.

110
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:49,760
Is it possible she was not the child bride?

111
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,560
I did my research.

112
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:57,840
She came from an opera troupe.

113
00:07:57,920 --> 00:08:00,320
After she was sold to the Chow family,

114
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:04,240
she occasionally performed in
different outfits.

115
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,920
Murder suspect fell from
an industrial building,

116
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:12,320
broke her left leg
and died a horrible death.

117
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:17,520
Auntie Mui said Master Chow's dog
broke its left leg.

118
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:21,040
Mom was the child bride?

119
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,200
These amulets are not the same.

120
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:31,680
Why would Angie's amulet say these things?

121
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,480
I'm glad you're home.

122
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:42,160
Why are you sprawled out on my bed again?

123
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,440
Mom?

124
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,080
Wow, you made such a mess.

125
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:48,960
Move over. Let me clean that up for you.

126
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:51,600
No...I'll do it myself.

127
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,520
Why did you give me earrings?

128
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:24,720
Remember it's been two months
since we started dating?

129
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:32,960
Mom is connected to Sylvia's death?!

130
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,960
Mom?

131
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,680
Oh, you're home early.

132
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:46,720
What? You just got back to work,
are you busy?

133
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:48,080
It's OK.

134
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:51,360
I'm about to do laundry,

135
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,440
but I don't have a full load.

136
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,120
Let me wash your jacket.

137
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,800
No need.

138
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:59,600
Why not? You've been wearing that
for a long time.

139
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:01,040
I really don't need to wash it.

140
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:03,920
Give it to me...
No need, Mom...

141
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,520
When did you find this?

142
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:13,320
Why was Mom's ring Sylvia's flat?

143
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:17,200
I found it behind the sofa earlier.

144
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:19,280
Is it very important?

145
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:25,040
Your Dad gave me this ring
when we got married.

146
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,360
Our wedding day is engraved on it.

147
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,640
Mom, I'm going on a business trip.

148
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,240
I need to go pack.

149
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,960
Will you eat dinner before you go?

150
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,320
Davis?

151
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:56,080
Angie, can I stay here for a few days?

152
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:59,280
Bad time? There's a guy in there?

153
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:01,440
Don't be silly. Come on in.

154
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:08,000
What is it? Had a fight with Mom?

155
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:12,720
Yeah, about moving overseas.

156
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,360
I plan to give her time to think it over.

157
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:19,320
Don't pressure her.

158
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:23,200
I know you're trying to persuade her
because of me.

159
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:26,160
Why don't we take a trip to Japan?

160
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:28,080
Maybe she'll change her mind.

161
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,520
I haven't been here since our divorce.

162
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,760
I thought you tossed my paintings.

163
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,960
Of course not. You did such a great job.

164
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,520
Let me get you something to eat.

165
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:45,680
Relax a bit. Take a shower.

166
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:48,000
You'll find the towels in the same place.

167
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,720
(several days later)

168
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:09,840
Son, you haven't answered me in a few days.

169
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,320
You won't tell me where you are.

170
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,320
You weren't like this before.

171
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:54,160
Oh, he's staying with Angie.

172
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:03,200
Angie!

173
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,440
Morning, Mom!

174
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,080
Morning!

175
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:08,240
Great! I called you up suddenly

176
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:10,320
and you're here in such a short time.

177
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,520
Davis dropped you off?

178
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,600
Yes, he's working on an urgent project.

179
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:15,200
He's in the office now.

180
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,840
He didn't tell me he's staying with you.

181
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:21,120
Sorry, Mom! I thought he did.

182
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,120
He lied about going on a business trip

183
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,880
and left me on read.

184
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,800
I don't know what he's up to.

185
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:28,880
Am I really so scary?

186
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,040
Of course not!

187
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:34,240
I think he wants to give you time to think.

188
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:38,080
We'd love to have you move to
Japan with us.

189
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:41,280
He's already thinking about
how to design the roof

190
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:43,360
so you can grow something there.

191
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:45,600
He really cares about you.

192
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:48,440
Come on, smile!

193
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,960
Mom, where are you going? I'll go with you.

194
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:55,120
We can do something to relax.

195
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:58,080
The restaurant downstairs is quite good.

196
00:13:58,280 --> 00:13:59,680
Let's go there.

197
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,760
Why do you have that earring?

198
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,120
What about it?

199
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,800
Take it off, let me see...

200
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,040
Hold on...Mom, wait...
Take it off...

201
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:11,360
Yiu Wai-lan...

202
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,680
Crime Unit, New Territories East.

203
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:16,960
Ms. Yiu, we suspect you're connected to
Siu Zi-yiu's murder.

204
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:19,200
Please come down to the Police station.

205
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:24,240
Yiu Wai-lan, over the past month,

206
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:26,320
have you met with Siu Zi-yiu?

207
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,360
No.

208
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,760
We found a video from
Siu Zi-yiu's cloud storage

209
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,520
which was recorded two weeks ago.

210
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:34,800
It showed you visiting her studio

211
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,720
and you got into a fight with her.

212
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:40,080
You warned her to stop harassing
Yau You-fong

213
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,600
or you'll make sure nothing good
would come to her.

214
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:43,840
Why did you hide your meeting
with Siu Zi-yiu?

215
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,080
Is it because you think she tried to
con money from your son

216
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,840
and you killed her in a rage?

217
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,360
No!

218
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:02,880
You're back!

219
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,120
What a feast!

220
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:12,560
It's the third anniversary of
our first date.

221
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:15,040
Sorry, I didn't get you anything.

222
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:20,440
It's OK. I'm wearing the pearl earrings
you gave me before we got married.

223
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,280
Aren't they pretty?

224
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:22,880
It's not Sylvia's earring.

225
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,920
Why do you look so stunned?

226
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,760
Nothing.

227
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,600
Cheers!

228
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,040
Cheers!

229
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,800
Well? Is everything OK?

230
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:45,600
Mom has a birth mark on her calf.

231
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:48,080
What do you mean?

232
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:50,800
Since we told her we're getting married,

233
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:53,120
she's been acting weird.

234
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:56,720
I agree. She's been acting weird.

235
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:59,280
She contacted you?

236
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,200
What did she say?

237
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:04,880
Not much. What happened?

238
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,680
I'm confused...

239
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,760
I don't know how to explain.

240
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:15,280
Someone I thought was close to me,
someone I thought I knew so well...

241
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:18,640
I dare not think anymore.
I'm afraid I'll lose everyone.

242
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:25,440
Don't be silly. You still have me.

243
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:53,600
Sylvia...

244
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:58,560
Who?

245
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:01,720
What did I say?

246
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,720
You called me Sylvia!

247
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:09,640
You're still thinking about Sylvia!

248
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,400
No, Angie! I'm sorry!

249
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:12,640
I don't know why...

250
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:15,160
Because she had a place in your heart.

251
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:18,480
You missed her subconsciously.

252
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:23,040
Haven't we been through enough?

253
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,600
Why can't you make up your mind?

254
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:26,480
Angie, it's not like that...

255
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:28,720
I'm Man Nga-kei.

256
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:31,400
I'm the one you're marrying.

257
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:33,560
Why?

258
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:37,600
Haven't I done enough? Why? Tell me why!

259
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:40,640
I'm sorry...

260
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,520
I have been drinking...I'm not sober.

261
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:48,840
Maybe...because I gave the same
earring to Sylvia.

262
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:51,560
What did you say?

263
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:55,520
You gave the same earring to her?

264
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,760
What do you take me for?

265
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:59,440
Her replacement?

266
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,400
No, Angie! You're not...

267
00:18:00,560 --> 00:18:02,720
How could you be so cruel?

268
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:03,680
It's not like that.

269
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,760
Why?

270
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:08,640
Yau You-fong, I hate you!

271
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,040
Calm down, Angie!

272
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:12,800
You've been lying from the start.

273
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,600
No, Angie! Please calm down.

274
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:16,320
It's not enough you hurt me once.

275
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:19,040
How many times must you hurt me? Tell me...

276
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:20,480
I hate you...
Calm down...

277
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,240
I hate you!

278
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,920
Is that Sylvia's head?

279
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:39,440
I'm asking you if that was Sylvia's head?

280
00:18:41,360 --> 00:18:43,680
Did you kill Sylvia?

281
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:48,640
What kind of human being are you?

282
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:51,680
You killed her and put her head
inside a stuffed animal?

283
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:53,920
Have you gone mad?

284
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:57,160
Just think I kept saying

285
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:59,520
my beloved Angie is the most
gentle and simple.

286
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,600
She's not capable of killing anyone.

287
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:06,360
See? I sounded you out and
you gave yourself away.

288
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:08,360
Are you the killer?

289
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,160
You sounded me out?

290
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:14,120
You knew Sylvia all along.

291
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,920
But you never said anything.

292
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:18,400
What else are you holding out on me?

293
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:20,720
How could you be so heartless
to kill Sylvia?

294
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,400
Because she deserved it!

295
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:25,640
I paid her to help me

296
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:28,160
but she stole you from me.

297
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:29,880
Help you to do what?

298
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:34,840
I was heartbroken when you
asked for a divorce.

299
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:38,640
I saw that tramp on a fortune telling show.

300
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:42,240
She claimed she could help couples
patch things up.

301
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:45,600
So I approached her anonymously.

302
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:50,720
She said if I gave her our birth data,

303
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:53,560
she could help me

304
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:57,560
and I'll have good news in 60 days.

305
00:19:57,640 --> 00:20:00,400
For a while, I kept running into you

306
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:03,760
and I thought she could really help me.

307
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:07,440
But she turned around and took you from me.

308
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:10,040
I tried everything I could

309
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:12,960
to dig up compromising materials

310
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:14,880
to discredit her.

311
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:16,800
I want revenge.

312
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:19,320
When I went up to her studio.

313
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,760
Guess what I saw?

314
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:24,960
She did nothing about our birth data.

315
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,800
She bound her birth data with yours

316
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:30,800
and tried to con money from you.

317
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,880
Luckily, you didn't fall for it.

318
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:36,880
But you still care a lot about her.

319
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:39,680
I know she had enemies...

320
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:41,560
I continued to discredit her

321
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:44,080
so you'll see her for who she is.

322
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:47,320
Then she showed up at my doorstep.

323
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:51,920
But she didn't come here to apologize.

324
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:54,480
She told me you'll never be mine.

325
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,400
If you're so confident,

326
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:58,320
let me call Davis now

327
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:01,440
and tell him everything you have done.

328
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:05,040
No...I beg you...
Get away from me...

329
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:07,920
Sorry, I didn't mean it...

330
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:09,840
Bloody hell!

331
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:12,160
You accused me of conning Davis?

332
00:21:12,320 --> 00:21:15,200
It's not just money.
He'll give me anything.

333
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:16,960
While you, like these paintings you see,

334
00:21:17,120 --> 00:21:19,640
are bored like a stiff.

335
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:22,120
Don't touch Davis' paintings...

336
00:21:26,560 --> 00:21:27,640
Help...

337
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,320
Help...

338
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:01,920
Sylvia...

339
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:05,920
I don't con just anyone.

340
00:22:06,080 --> 00:22:08,720
I like him because he's cute and fun.

341
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:10,360
I'm ignoring him for now

342
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:12,600
and then I'll spill the beans on you.

343
00:22:23,120 --> 00:22:24,400
Angie?

344
00:22:42,120 --> 00:22:45,280
Angie...

345
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:51,160
I didn't mean it...

346
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:53,800
It was self-defense.

347
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:56,480
You killed Sylvia?

348
00:22:57,320 --> 00:23:02,720
She came up to confront me.

349
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:07,440
She said many things and tried to hurt me.

350
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:14,840
I grabbed a knife and stabbed her.

351
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:18,480
Now what?

352
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:22,080
Let's call the Police.

353
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:28,120
I won't go to jail.

354
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:30,720
I'll lose everything.

355
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:34,240
You should go...I'll take care of this.

356
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:37,120
How?

357
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:39,440
Angie, turn yourself in.

358
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:41,840
Sylvia came up looking for trouble.

359
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:44,960
It was self-defense, right?

360
00:23:45,320 --> 00:23:52,400
I'm Davis' ex-wife, she was his ex.

361
00:23:52,560 --> 00:23:54,480
The Police won't believe me.

362
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:57,560
Don't call the Police.

363
00:23:57,680 --> 00:24:05,440
Liz, I beg you...please help me.

364
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:10,840
Don't say anything. I'm begging you.

365
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:18,960
It's OK. You should go.

366
00:24:19,840 --> 00:24:22,000
I'll take care of it.

367
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:24,120
I didn't mean it.

368
00:24:24,520 --> 00:24:27,840
I didn't mean to kill her.

369
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:34,360
But on second thought...she deserved it.

370
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:38,240
After I killed her,

371
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:40,360
I cut off her head

372
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:42,720
and removed her fingerprints.

373
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,400
Then I took her body to the hillside.

374
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:48,000
Even if the body was discovered,

375
00:24:48,120 --> 00:24:50,600
It'll take some time to identify her.

376
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:54,160
That witch had so many enemies,

377
00:24:54,320 --> 00:24:56,360
I'm not on top of the list.

378
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:59,880
How could you do something so inhumane?

379
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:04,480
Did you arrange for those weird things
that happened to me?

380
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:08,320
Yes. In the beginning,

381
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:12,160
I just didn't want anyone to know
I killed Sylvia...

382
00:25:12,280 --> 00:25:15,600
Those born in the Year of the Dragon,
Snake and Horse,

383
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:20,120
your luck with romance is in the east.

384
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:23,120
You used my deepfake account
and posed as Sylvia to livestream.

385
00:25:23,280 --> 00:25:25,080
Did you know you'll get me in trouble?

386
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:28,160
I'm sorry. I only did the livestreaming

387
00:25:28,320 --> 00:25:30,120
so people would think she was still alive.

388
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:32,880
I didn't realize not using the app properly

389
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:34,360
would get in trouble.

390
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:37,120
What you did will lead the Police to
my doorstep

391
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:39,160
once they start to investigate.

392
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:41,320
Then don't let people get suspicious.

393
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,960
You're good with deepfake,

394
00:25:43,080 --> 00:25:44,880
if you pose as Sylvia,

395
00:25:45,040 --> 00:25:46,800
there won't be any flickering

396
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:48,160
and people won't suspect anything.

397
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:49,880
You want me to pose as her?

398
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:56,320
Please, Liz? Only you can help me.

399
00:25:57,880 --> 00:26:01,200
In reverse...it means luck
is not on our side.

400
00:26:01,320 --> 00:26:03,880
But that brat is still not convinced.

401
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:07,320
He planned to talk to her after work.

402
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:09,600
I hope he'll wake up.

403
00:26:11,560 --> 00:26:12,800
Auntie, I'm sorry.

404
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:15,840
I'm due back at the TV station
for a meeting.

405
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:18,560
I'll drop by your place tonight
after work to drink it.

406
00:26:19,320 --> 00:26:21,040
Since you won't let go,

407
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:23,680
I had to be more thorough.

408
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:32,960
Sylvia, open the door.

409
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:35,440
Let's sit down and talk, OK?

410
00:26:35,600 --> 00:26:36,880
Sylvia...

411
00:26:37,360 --> 00:26:38,400
Sylvia...

412
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:42,480
(Scumbag, I don't want to see you anymore)

413
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:43,120
(I will not forgive you)

414
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:43,680
(I'm returning your things)

415
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:45,120
(What you owe me, I won't let it slide)

416
00:26:56,160 --> 00:27:00,400
You promised me you'll quit when
he stops looking for Sylvia.

417
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:02,800
I will. You should go.

418
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:13,040
You hurt yourself and lied to me.

419
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:19,640
Because I realized when I'm hurt,

420
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:22,120
you'll care about me

421
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:24,600
and you'll stay with me.

422
00:27:24,760 --> 00:27:28,120
I'll do anything for you.

423
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:30,600
I can sacrifice anything.

424
00:27:30,720 --> 00:27:33,440
But you sacrificed Liz.

425
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:35,920
You killed someone and
she covered up for you.

426
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:38,080
You think she was sincere?

427
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:42,400
She felt guilty.

428
00:27:42,520 --> 00:27:45,680
She didn't really want to help me.

429
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:54,280
We were inseparable since college.

430
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:58,280
But because of you...

431
00:27:58,400 --> 00:28:00,560
She never liked you

432
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:02,080
and always criticized you.

433
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:04,720
I can put up with that...

434
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:10,800
But in the end, when we were
about to break up,

435
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:13,320
she went to bed with you!

436
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:19,360
I couldn't get in touch with
her afterwards.

437
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:22,360
Then she started livestreaming on her own.

438
00:28:22,520 --> 00:28:24,640
If I wasn't worried about her
blowing our cover,

439
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:27,920
I wouldn't have tipped her off.

440
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:41,680
I really must go. Bye!

441
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:45,280
But I need to find her.

442
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,720
Finally, she called me back.

443
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:47,840
Hello, Liz?

444
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:51,520
I know I must settle this.

445
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:53,840
But I can't let you find me.

446
00:28:55,360 --> 00:28:56,720
(No signal from device)

447
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:01,400
I finally went to see her.

448
00:29:01,520 --> 00:29:03,680
Come with me. Turn yourself in.

449
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:05,440
Let go. I won't turn myself in.

450
00:29:05,600 --> 00:29:07,840
I'm wanted by the Police.

451
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,840
You want me dead too?

452
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,240
You said you would leave.

453
00:29:12,360 --> 00:29:14,720
I'm only helping you because
you're my bestie.

454
00:29:14,840 --> 00:29:16,640
I'm your bestie?

455
00:29:16,800 --> 00:29:19,680
You're helping me because you feel guilty.

456
00:29:20,080 --> 00:29:22,080
You thought I didn't know?

457
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:26,040
You slept with Davis, didn't you?

458
00:29:26,120 --> 00:29:28,080
Why did you do this to me?

459
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:29,200
How long have we known each other?

460
00:29:29,360 --> 00:29:31,160
Why did you do this to me?

461
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:40,160
Yes...I slept with Davis.

462
00:29:42,800 --> 00:29:46,400
But I was drunk, I acted on an impulse.

463
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:56,480
All along, I felt guilty towards you.

464
00:29:57,280 --> 00:29:59,200
But what about him?

465
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:01,440
He proposed the very next day!

466
00:30:01,560 --> 00:30:03,600
What was his reason?

467
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:06,960
Because he knew I'm the one he loves.

468
00:30:07,080 --> 00:30:08,880
No!

469
00:30:09,280 --> 00:30:11,840
He was a player. He felt guilty.

470
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:12,640
Let go of me!

471
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:14,960
Your marriage was a mistake.

472
00:30:15,360 --> 00:30:18,400
Angie, turn yourself in.

473
00:30:18,520 --> 00:30:19,800
I won't do it.

474
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:24,120
If Davis knew I killed someone,
he'd ditch me. Let go, Liz...

475
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:25,520
What about me?

476
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:29,400
I didn't kill anyone.

477
00:30:29,520 --> 00:30:32,840
I'm innocent. Come with me.

478
00:30:33,840 --> 00:30:35,320
Let go!

479
00:30:51,920 --> 00:30:55,680
Man Nga-kei, where else can you go?

480
00:30:57,680 --> 00:31:02,480
It was entirely my doing.

481
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:04,160
I'm letting go.

482
00:31:04,560 --> 00:31:09,320
If I'm dead, then it'll be over.

483
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:14,120
Angie, calm down! Don't jump!

484
00:31:15,560 --> 00:31:22,040
Angie...don't you remember?

485
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:25,800
We have been through so much since college.

486
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:27,920
Including this.

487
00:31:28,040 --> 00:31:32,400
It'll be too late if you don't
turn yourself in.

488
00:31:33,080 --> 00:31:36,960
I beg you...turn yourself in.

489
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:40,880
I slept with Davis.

490
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:46,400
All along, I felt guilty towards you.

491
00:31:58,480 --> 00:32:01,120
I slept with Davis.

492
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:06,240
All along, I felt guilty towards you.

493
00:32:17,840 --> 00:32:21,160
I had to kill her. I had no choice.

494
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:23,680
She knew too much.

495
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:26,480
There's no other way.

496
00:32:36,320 --> 00:32:37,320
(No signal from device)

497
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,520
(Chung Hung Industrial Building)

498
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:02,320
Angie?

499
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:07,360
No...Angie...

500
00:33:08,120 --> 00:33:10,080
You and Liz cheated on me.

501
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:15,920
I can forgive you... because I love you.

502
00:33:17,160 --> 00:33:21,800
I was thrilled when you proposed
the other day.

503
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:24,480
I thought you have changed.

504
00:33:24,600 --> 00:33:28,640
But you suspected me

505
00:33:28,800 --> 00:33:31,280
and tested me with that tramp's name!

506
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:34,000
I meant it when I proposed.

507
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:36,960
I genuinely wanted to be with you.

508
00:33:37,080 --> 00:33:38,880
But you made me suspect my mother.

509
00:33:39,360 --> 00:33:41,840
You said there was a problem with
the amulet Mom gave you.

510
00:33:41,960 --> 00:33:44,240
But it wasn't the one she gave you.

511
00:33:44,360 --> 00:33:46,280
I asked Uncle Kim about it.

512
00:33:46,560 --> 00:33:48,000
What's the story with this peach wood sword

513
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,800
and Sylvia's earring?

514
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:52,640
I told Lan to put them in a flowerpot.

515
00:33:52,760 --> 00:33:55,680
Lan told me the girl had your head spinning

516
00:33:55,840 --> 00:33:57,720
and she was afraid you'd sell the flat.

517
00:33:57,840 --> 00:34:00,800
So she confronted Sylvia at her studio

518
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:04,080
and secretly stole one of her earrings.

519
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:06,160
She gave it to me and asked me

520
00:34:06,320 --> 00:34:09,040
to use magic to make that witch go away.

521
00:34:09,120 --> 00:34:12,160
But we saw on the news

522
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:14,840
Sylvia died two weeks ago.

523
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:17,360
Which means when Lan came to me,

524
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:19,440
Sylvia was already dead.

525
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:21,600
If she killed Sylvia,

526
00:34:21,720 --> 00:34:23,920
she wouldn't need me to chase her away.

527
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:27,120
When Lan found out Sylvia was murdered,

528
00:34:27,240 --> 00:34:29,440
she felt very uneasy.

529
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:34,320
I told her to bury the peach wood sword
and the earring in a flowerpot

530
00:34:34,520 --> 00:34:36,480
so the deceased can rest in peace

531
00:34:36,640 --> 00:34:38,480
and reincarnate soon.

532
00:34:38,640 --> 00:34:39,680
They said on the news,

533
00:34:39,800 --> 00:34:41,840
they found next to Sylvia's body

534
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:45,920
a vajra, the Nine Grid and Eight Diagrams
and a Ghau prayer box.

535
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:47,920
Those are Buddhist apparatus.

536
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:51,440
Taoist like us don't use them.

537
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:54,560
Uncle Kim confirmed Mom didn't kill Sylvia.

538
00:34:54,720 --> 00:34:57,120
But I don't know why you
switched the amulet.

539
00:34:57,240 --> 00:34:59,760
So I hired a private detective

540
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:02,800
and found out you knew Sylvia all along

541
00:35:02,920 --> 00:35:07,040
and I saw from your phone you asked
Sylvia to fix our Spouse Palace.

542
00:35:07,160 --> 00:35:08,560
I also saw from your research,

543
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:11,600
you knew Chun Ming Mountain is deserted.

544
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:14,720
So you dumped Sylvia's body out there.

545
00:35:15,440 --> 00:35:20,560
Yes...I did all that...

546
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:25,600
Now you know how far I would go for you.

547
00:35:25,720 --> 00:35:28,160
How much I can sacrifice for you.

548
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:32,080
Angie, you killed someone.

549
00:35:32,200 --> 00:35:33,760
You're not the Angie I know.

550
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:36,880
I did nothing wrong. They did.

551
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:39,240
Liz seduced you.

552
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:43,720
She betrayed me. She's not worthy.

553
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:46,000
She deserved to die.

554
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:50,960
Your mother wanted you for herself.

555
00:35:51,080 --> 00:35:52,640
She wanted to be with you.

556
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,880
I want her to lose you forever.

557
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,880
Sylvia thinks she's so pretty

558
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:58,480
and she wanted you.

559
00:35:58,600 --> 00:36:01,280
That's why I cut off her head
and put it here.

560
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:03,760
I want her to see how much
we love each other.

561
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:06,080
I want her to turn in her grave.

562
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:10,080
It wasn't entirely their fault.

563
00:36:10,640 --> 00:36:12,480
What about me?

564
00:36:12,640 --> 00:36:15,720
If I would settle down

565
00:36:16,800 --> 00:36:20,080
and cherish you properly

566
00:36:20,720 --> 00:36:22,880
you wouldn't turn out like this.

567
00:36:23,640 --> 00:36:26,720
I just don't want to lose you.

568
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:32,000
I never expected things to
turn out like this.

569
00:36:35,600 --> 00:36:37,680
This lot said

570
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:42,320
if we stick together and never give up,

571
00:36:42,920 --> 00:36:46,560
we can overcome anything.

572
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:50,320
Why didn't that happen?

573
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:54,880
Angie...
Stay away...

574
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:56,800
I won't give up.

575
00:36:56,920 --> 00:37:00,560
Please don't come any closer.

576
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:02,760
Turn yourself in.

577
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:05,040
We'll both plead your case.

578
00:37:05,200 --> 00:37:07,840
Remember we agreed,

579
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:11,040
wherever the finishing line is,

580
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:14,800
I'll always be with you.

581
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:22,080
(Kwan Sir, Crime Unit)

582
00:37:29,680 --> 00:37:32,320
How could I be so stupid?

583
00:37:32,480 --> 00:37:33,520
Angie...

584
00:37:33,720 --> 00:37:34,880
Stay away from me!

585
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:35,920
It's not what you think.

586
00:37:36,080 --> 00:37:37,120
Shut up!

587
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:38,400
I don't want you to make any more mistakes.

588
00:37:38,560 --> 00:37:42,880
The worst mistake I made was loving you
at all costs.

589
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:45,760
You're still lying to me at this moment.

590
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:47,640
Shut up...
Put down the knife...

591
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:49,920
You're lying to me...
Put it down, Angie!

592
00:38:05,680 --> 00:38:10,320
No one can separate us anymore.

593
00:38:16,080 --> 00:38:18,680
Drop the weapon...

594
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:21,720
No, let me go...

595
00:38:21,840 --> 00:38:24,800
Man Nga-kei, you're suspected of committing
multiple murders and attempted murder.

596
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:26,320
You're now under arrest.

597
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:29,160
Yau You-fong...

598
00:38:42,760 --> 00:38:45,440
Hey, son, you're awake!

599
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:47,920
You're looking good today.

600
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:53,600
If you suspected anything, you should have
called the Police sooner.

601
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:56,280
Don't wait till the last minute
to call Kwan Sir.

602
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,840
Do you realize how dangerous it was?

603
00:38:58,040 --> 00:39:00,000
You almost died!

604
00:39:00,200 --> 00:39:05,920
I can't believe Angie was more
terrifying than the witch.

605
00:39:06,080 --> 00:39:10,560
All those weird things, the rashes

606
00:39:10,720 --> 00:39:13,360
and the dead plants

607
00:39:13,560 --> 00:39:15,600
were entirely her doing.

608
00:39:16,040 --> 00:39:17,760
After Angie was arrested,

609
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:19,280
they came up to search for evidence.

610
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:22,560
Kwan Sir told me the vitamins
you were taking,

611
00:39:22,680 --> 00:39:24,480
have been switched to penicillin.

612
00:39:24,600 --> 00:39:27,160
Those rashes on your neck

613
00:39:27,280 --> 00:39:30,320
were caused by penicillin.

614
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:33,760
Herbicide was added to the soil,

615
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:36,240
that's why the plants died.

616
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:40,000
Can't believe Angie did all that
behind our backs.

617
00:39:40,200 --> 00:39:41,600
Mom...

618
00:39:45,120 --> 00:39:46,960
I'm sorry!

619
00:39:48,160 --> 00:39:50,080
I checked up on you.

620
00:39:51,400 --> 00:39:54,240
It's over. Don't look back.

621
00:39:54,600 --> 00:40:01,120
Just remember, only I want
what's best for you.

622
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:06,560
I hereby declare...

623
00:40:06,640 --> 00:40:09,360
the defendant Man Nga-kei is found guilty of

624
00:40:09,520 --> 00:40:13,720
murder and inflicting grievous bodily harm,

625
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:15,760
and is sentenced to life imprisonment.

626
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:26,480
Ning-yuk, I'll see you soon.

627
00:40:28,640 --> 00:40:30,200
Wait for me.

628
00:40:36,080 --> 00:40:38,200
(Chow Kai-hin &amp; Ning-yuk)

629
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:42,320
Master, how could you be so heartless?

630
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:44,560
After all that I have done for you,

631
00:40:44,720 --> 00:40:47,360
I wore the wedding gown you gave me

632
00:40:47,520 --> 00:40:50,080
and got married on the same day.

633
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:54,680
I thought I would take her place
in your heart.

634
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:58,720
But you'd rather die and be with her.

635
00:40:58,840 --> 00:41:04,160
What's the point of me staying alive?

636
00:41:04,280 --> 00:41:08,680
Kai-hin, I hope to see you in the next life.

637
00:41:09,040 --> 00:41:12,640
I won't let anyone keep us apart again.

638
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:20,680
How did our lives turn out like this?

639
00:41:21,720 --> 00:41:22,560
(Hin)

640
00:41:22,640 --> 00:41:24,960
Is it everything our own doing?

641
00:41:28,560 --> 00:41:31,520
The doctor said Angie turned out like this

642
00:41:31,640 --> 00:41:34,880
because she's too fixated on
our relationship.

643
00:41:34,960 --> 00:41:38,960
She refused to give up even after
our divorce.

644
00:41:39,240 --> 00:41:42,480
She used everything in her power
to make things happen.

645
00:41:42,640 --> 00:41:44,800
When she came across the Chow mansion

646
00:41:44,920 --> 00:41:48,080
and heard about the story of
Master Chow and Miss Koo

647
00:41:48,480 --> 00:41:51,360
she projected her own experience
into their story.

648
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:55,520
Perhaps like the child bride in the story,

649
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:59,160
she was too anxious to win over

650
00:41:59,240 --> 00:42:02,400
or to possess Master Chow,

651
00:42:02,520 --> 00:42:04,560
even the kindest person

652
00:42:05,040 --> 00:42:07,760
can become a terrifying lover.
